<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">成长 · {{nickname || '球员'}}</view>
    <view class="muted">真实评分历史（无模拟分）。点一条可看详情与复测对比。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">近期评分</view>
  <view class="banner-note" wx:if="{{historyBanner}}">{{historyBanner}}</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:elif="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="trend card" wx:if="{{history.length}}">
    <view class="trend-bars">
      <view class="bar-wrap" wx:for="{{historyAsc}}" wx:key="video_id">
        <view class="bar" style="height: {{item.barHeight}}rpx;"></view>
        <text class="bar-label">{{item.overall_score}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">简单趋势（左旧右新，纵轴为总分）</view>
  </view>

  <view
    class="card"
    wx:for="{{history}}"
    wx:key="video_id"
    bindtap="goVideoDetail"
    data-id="{{item.video_id}}"
  >
    <view class="row">
      <text class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:0;">{{item.skill_name}}</text>
      <text class="big-mini">{{item.overall_score}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx;">
      {{item.primary_issue_title || '无明显问题'}} · {{item.createdText}}
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.benchmark_kind}}">{{item.benchmark_kind}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !history.length}}">
    暂无评分。去「学动作」→ 拍摄引导 → 上传，完成真实评分后再看成长。
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">上传记录</view>
  <view
    class="card"
    wx:for="{{videos}}"
    wx:key="id"
    bindtap="goVideoDetail"
    data-id="{{item.id}}"
  >
    <view class="row">
      <text>{{item.skill_name}}</text>
      <text class="tag warn">{{item.jobStatusLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">{{item.createdText}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
